Late-start fix for upstream gear_sonic_deploy g1_deploy_onnx_ref (NVlabs/GR00T-WholeBodyControl @ b042411), applied ON TOP of sonic_probe.patch.
A change to upstream's deployment: the control thread sets SCHED_FIFO $SONIC_CTRL_FIFO on itself, and with SONIC_MAIN_SLEEP=abs the
main loop sleeps to absolute 20 ms deadlines instead of busy-spinning. Inert when both variables are unset. Needs root or CAP_SYS_NICE.
Apache License 2.0 (a modification of NVIDIA's g1_deploy_onnx_ref.cpp; see NOTICE). Code identical to the build we measured; comments
and the header's file name were edited for publication.
  patch -d $SONIC_REPO -p1 < sonic/harness/latefix.patch

